n A minor, Vivaldi - The Four Seasons<br><strong>Saturday 21st November (6pm and 8pm)</strong> - Bach - Violin Concerto in A minor BWV1041&nbsp;, Vivaldi - The Four Seasons&nbsp;<br>",
